<div data-seo-research-tool>
  <section class="research-hero" id="import-plan" aria-labelledby="research-title">
    <h1 id="research-title">Turn one AI fanout into an SEO research brief.</h1>
    <p>See what should be answered, which proof is still needed and what to validate before changing your website. The existing AI Fanout result is reused; nothing is searched again.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary-action" href="https://ai-fanout.com/#tool">Run one fanout on AI Fanout <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><button class="quiet-button" type="button" data-load-example>View a synthetic example</button></div>
    <output class="handoff-status" data-handoff-status aria-live="polite">Waiting for a browser-local AI Fanout result.</output>
  </section>

  <section id="explorer">
    <div class="research-empty" data-empty-state>
      <div><h2>Leave with a usable brief—not a longer keyword list.</h2><p>The result converts one visible fanout into research tasks, evidence requirements and explicit unknowns.</p></div>
      <ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Run AI Fanout once</strong><p>Choose the queries that matter in the provider-exposed result.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Open the SEO brief</strong><p>The visible result travels only in your browser and is removed from the address bar.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Act on the gaps</strong><p>Research the missing proof, then validate demand and existing-page fit before publishing.</p></div></li></ol>
    </div>

    <article class="research-result" data-research-result hidden aria-labelledby="result-question">
      <header class="research-result-head"><div><p class="mono-label" data-result-label>Browser-local SEO brief</p><h2 id="result-question" data-result-question></h2><p data-result-summary></p></div><dl><div><dt>Provider and model</dt><dd data-provider></dd></div><div><dt>Market</dt><dd data-market></dd></div><div><dt>Evidence state</dt><dd data-evidence></dd></div></dl></header>

      <section class="takeaway" aria-labelledby="takeaway-title"><p class="mono-label" data-takeaway-label>Your practical takeaway</p><h3 id="takeaway-title" data-working-title></h3><p data-working-rationale></p></section>

      <section class="research-metrics" aria-label="Research summary"><div><strong data-query-count>0</strong><span>queries to cover</span></div><div><strong data-task-count>0</strong><span>research tasks</span></div><div><strong data-source-count>0</strong><span>source links available</span></div><div><strong data-decision-state>Open</strong><span>publication decision</span></div></section>

      <section class="brief-grid">
        <div class="brief-tasks"><p class="mono-label" data-brief-label>Working brief</p><h3 data-brief-title>Answer these questions and bring the right proof.</h3><ol class="task-list" data-task-list></ol></div>
        <aside class="evidence-panel"><p class="mono-label" data-evidence-mix-label>Evidence already in the run</p><h3 data-evidence-mix-title>What kind of sources are available?</h3><ul class="evidence-mix" data-evidence-mix></ul><p class="scope-note" data-source-scope-note></p></aside>
      </section>

      <section class="validation-grid">
        <div><p class="mono-label" data-gaps-label>Before you change a page</p><h3 data-gaps-title>Three things this run still cannot decide.</h3><ul class="unknown-list" data-unknown-list></ul></div>
        <div class="next-action"><p class="mono-label" data-next-label>Recommended next action</p><h3 data-next-title>Turn the fanout into verified inputs.</h3><p data-next-action></p><a class="primary-action" href="https://crawlfoundry.com/features/keyword-database?utm_source=seo-fanout.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=research_workflow" data-contextter-cta>Check demand and existing pages in Crawl Foundry <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="ownership-note">SEO Fanout, AI Fanout and Crawl Foundry are operated by Matthias Ramahi. This workflow connection is not independent validation.</p></div>
      </section>

      <details class="raw-evidence"><summary data-raw-summary>Show the transferred queries and exact source scope</summary><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Exposed query</th><th>Research job</th><th>Source status</th><th>Visible domains</th></tr></thead><tbody data-query-table-body></tbody></table></div></details>

      <section class="result-footer"><div><strong data-export-title>Take the brief with you</strong><p data-export-copy>Copy a readable brief or download the complete local evidence record.</p></div><div class="result-actions"><button type="button" data-copy-brief>Copy research brief</button><button type="button" data-download-brief>Download JSON</button><a href="https://ai-fanout.com/#tool">Run another fanout</a></div></section>
      <aside class="limits"><strong>This result does not prove</strong><span>hidden searches</span><span>search volume</span><span>rankings</span><span>site coverage</span><span>citation probability</span></aside>
    </article>
  </section>
</div>

